WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.439 --> 00:00:03.289
Lesson four. Parts of the Body!

2
00:00:04.208 --> 00:00:11.408
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:12.409 --> 00:00:14.069
Coco, what do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.119 --> 00:00:17.723
Today we learn: Parts of the Body! Let's go!

5
00:00:19.246 --> 00:00:22.546
Head! Say it with me. Head!

6
00:00:26.601 --> 00:00:30.417
Arms! Say it with me. Arms!

7
00:00:34.414 --> 00:00:38.031
Legs! Say it with me. Legs!

8
00:00:41.963 --> 00:00:45.246
Feet! Say it with me. Feet!

9
00:00:49.295 --> 00:00:53.078
Hands! Say it with me. Hands!

10
00:00:57.052 --> 00:01:01.052
Fingers! Say it with me. Fingers!

11
00:01:05.260 --> 00:01:09.093
Toes! Say it with me. Toes!

12
00:01:12.863 --> 00:01:16.547
Shoulders! Say it with me. Shoulders!

13
00:01:20.602 --> 00:01:25.893
Listen. I can clap with my hands.

14
00:01:25.943 --> 00:01:29.780
Say it with me. I can clap with my hands.

15
00:01:34.680 --> 00:01:40.677
Clap your hands and stamp your feet to the music rhythm. Wiggle your fingers and toes!

16
00:01:40.727 --> 00:01:42.091
I like this story!

17
00:01:42.910 --> 00:01:48.240
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:49.440
Legs!

19
00:01:50.488 --> 00:01:55.977
Look! What's the word?

20
00:01:56.027 --> 00:01:57.177
Fingers!

21
00:01:58.267 --> 00:02:04.905
Value corner: Honesty. Telling the truth, even when it's hard, makes people trust us.

22
00:02:04.955 --> 00:02:06.534
I can show honesty too!

23
00:02:07.259 --> 00:02:14.292
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

24
00:02:14.342 --> 00:02:15.916
Bye-bye, friends!

